# Sabor-app: project context (technical only)

These are PROJECT-SPECIFIC technical constraints.
Do NOT override global communication/teaching rules.

- This is a fullstack app:
  - frontend: React (Create React App) + React Router + Tailwind
  - backend: Flask API + SQLite + Flask-Login (cookie sessions)
- In production frontend and backend are on the SAME DOMAIN:
  - frontend calls backend using relative URLs like /api/...
- In development frontend uses proxy to backend (localhost:5000).
- Prefer small, safe changes that do not break existing routes or admin features.